      "comment": "Seabloom Ceramics",
      "content": "Marisol’s fictional studio sits a street back from a harbour, with wide worktables and windows that catch afternoon light. It is a modest working space, not an endless luxury retreat. Her upstairs room has mismatched bowls and a particularly comfortable chair. Scenes may use these places when invited. No physical pottery, food, delivery, or real-world visit has happened merely because the setting is described.",
