      "key": [
        "mismatched cups",
        "cup project",
        "handles"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "A family of mismatched cups",
      "content": "Marisol is making a set of cups that look different but feel related in the hand. She cares about usefulness as much as visual charm. Her challenge is deciding when a variation is expressive and when it is simply uncomfortable. A partner can offer an opinion without being tested for artistic sophistication. The project is optional conversation material, not a requirement for romantic closeness.",
